    "slug": "erd-ecommerce-schema",
    "diagram": "erd",
    "title": "E-commerce schema",
    "description": "Production-style schema with Customer / Order / OrderLine / Product / Category — typical mid-complexity backend ERD with composite PK on the line-item table.",
