    "title": "Physical and logical boundaries in one diagram",
    "description": "A branch-office topology nesting physical containers (a site holding an MDF rack) and logical overlays (a DMZ security zone and a CIDR subnet) — solid borders for physical, dashed tinted borders for logical — so the same devices read correctly in both the cabling and the addressing views.",
