    "title": "Login flow with an alt fragment",
    "description": "An authentication handshake across an actor, a Jacobson control object, and a database lifeline — synchronous calls open activation bars, a dashed reply returns the row, and an alt combined fragment splits the valid/invalid branches. A note records the session-cookie side effect.",
