    "description": "Generic European residential consumer unit per IEC 60364 / EN 61439-3 — service head, isolator, type-AC main RCD, and per-circuit MCBs for lighting, sockets, kitchen, water heater, EV charger (with type-B RCBO), and outdoor circuit.",
