    "diagram": "usecase",
    "title": "Online bookstore use case diagram (include + extend)",
    "description": "An e-commerce checkout use case diagram showing «include» chains, an «extend» relationship with a condition and extension point, and the extension-point compartment inside the base ellipse. A primary customer, an external payment gateway, and a supporting warehouse actor.",
